# Build context for e2e/edge.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file in place of the root
# .dockerignore, which leaves the web sources out of the API's build context).

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Never send secrets into a build context (ADR-0018).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.npmrc

.git
.github
.githooks
docs
infra
deploy
apps/api/src
apps/api/test
apps/api/prisma
